nflog2syslog (0.1.0-1) stable; urgency=medium

  * Initial release of the clean-room Rust rewrite of nflog-to-syslog.
    - JSON output per packet instead of key=value lines
    - decoupled pipeline with bounded queues and drop accounting
    - SO_RCVBUFFORCE socket sizing (fixes the ENOBUFS log-loss class)

 -- Bernd Zeimetz <bzed@debian.org>  Wed, 30 Sep 2026 12:00:00 +0200
